sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Orch as Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>8033/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Chunker as Caikit Chunker<br/>8085/TCP gRPC
    participant Detector as Detector Service(s)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant LLM as LLM Backend<br/>(TGIS/Caikit/vLLM)
    participant OTel as OTLP Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 1: Unary Classification with Text Generation

    Client->>Orch: POST /api/v1/task/classification-with-text-generation<br/>TLS (optional), mTLS (optional)
    Orch->>Chunker: Chunk input text<br/>gRPC TLS/mTLS, Client cert
    Chunker-->>Orch: Chunked text segments
    Orch->>Detector: Input detection on chunks<br/>POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>TLS/mTLS, Bearer token
    Detector-->>Orch: Detection results (pass/fail)

    alt Input detection passed
        Orch->>LLM: Generate text<br/>gRPC 8033/8085/TCP<br/>TLS/mTLS, Client cert
        LLM-->>Orch: Generated text
        Orch->>Detector: Output detection on generated text<br/>POST /api/v1/text/generation<br/>TLS/mTLS, Bearer token
        Detector-->>Orch: Detection results
        Orch-->>Client: Response with generation + detections
    else Input detection failed
        Orch-->>Client: Response with input detection results (no generation)
    end

    Orch--)OTel: Export trace spans + metrics (async)

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 2: Streaming Chat Completions with Detection

    Client->>Orch: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>TLS (optional), mTLS (optional)
    Orch->>Detector: Input detection on prompt<br/>TLS/mTLS, Bearer token
    Detector-->>Orch: Input detection results

    alt Input detection passed
        Orch->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions (stream=true)<br/>HTTP/HTTPS SSE, Bearer token
        loop Streaming generation chunks
            LLM-->>Orch: SSE chunk (delta content)
            Orch->>Chunker: Bidi-streaming chunk text<br/>gRPC TLS/mTLS
            Chunker-->>Orch: Tokenized chunk boundaries
            Orch->>Detector: Output detection on chunk batch<br/>TLS/mTLS, Bearer token
            Detector-->>Orch: Chunk detection results
            Note over Orch: DetectionBatchStream aggregates<br/>results via MaxProcessedIndex
            Orch-->>Client: SSE chunk with detection metadata
        end
        Orch-->>Client: SSE [DONE] termination
    else Input detection failed
        Orch-->>Client: SSE with detection results (no generation)
    end

    Orch--)OTel: Export trace spans + metrics (async)

    Note over Client,OTel: Flow 3: Streaming Content Detection (NDJSON)

    Client->>Orch: POST /api/v2/text/detection/stream-content<br/>NDJSON stream, TLS (optional)
    loop For each NDJSON content item
        Orch->>Chunker: Bidi-streaming chunk<br/>gRPC TLS/mTLS
        Chunker-->>Orch: Chunk boundaries
        Orch->>Detector: Detect on chunked content<br/>TLS/mTLS, Bearer token
        Detector-->>Orch: Detection results
        Orch-->>Client: NDJSON detection response line
    end
    Orch--)OTel: Export trace spans + metrics (async)
